### Login — captures {{token}} for the requests below
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Account — captures {{leagueId}} / {{userId}}
# @name account
GET {{baseUrl}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("leagueId", response.body.data.leagues[0].id);
    client.global.set("userId", response.body.data.leagues[0].user.id);
%}

### My squad — player ids only, see docs/rat.md for why
GET {{baseUrl}}/user?fields=players(id,owner)
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-League: {{leagueId}}
X-User: {{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Catalogue — name/position/price/altPositions/priceIncrement/points for every player, keyed by id. No auth required.
GET {{baseUrl}}/competitions/la-liga/data?lang=es&score=5
Accept: application/json

### Player historical market value — see docs/biwenger-api-notes.md (trailing ~1 year, no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/la-liga/{{playerId}}?fields=id,name,prices
Accept: application/json

### Player season list — season ids (end year) + point totals per format, see docs/biwenger-api-notes.md (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/la-liga/{{playerId}}?fields=id,name,seasons
Accept: application/json

### Player per-gameweek points for a season — see docs/biwenger-api-notes.md (season id from the request above, no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/la-liga/{{playerId}}?fields=id,name,reports&season={{seasonId}}
Accept: application/json

### Player photo — see docs/biwenger-api-notes.md (not an API response, a static asset)
GET https://cdn.biwenger.com/i/p/{{playerId}}.png

### Team crest — see docs/biwenger-api-notes.md
GET https://cdn.biwenger.com/i/t/{{teamId}}.png
